4 SOURCEFREE / DRAFT / INDEPENDENT REVIEW REQUIRED\n\n**Frozen protected PRE-MAIN source:** `integration/pre-main-reconciliation-r1@4f3413fc5c37b589be3412f826bf8f68ee617d4a`\n**Existing binding commission:** #682 (selected OCT28 W03/P01 compact C11 and W04/P02 compressed, regenerable accelerator).\n**No protected merge, science/authority change, source-right issuance, original35 native claim, or author self-acceptance.**\n\n### Actual code in this PR\n1. **W03: exact reviewed compression transplant**, no second engine. `rawlsing_next/_pre553_c11_execution_view.py` is **identical blob** `986f327aa18053edc61bd837cdded02bbf8388d9` to `02c1200b82b8397e551817e8e4cf2c6763413189`. The paired existing test is **identical blob** `8e8effa58579af0c3326ecd4af7e159947abe4ec`. This introduces bounded 256-event Zstd body chunks, on-demand exact materialization, bounded Parquet/Zstd row group writes with atomic stage/commit, and backwards-format compatible authenticated read. Selector-v1 I03 hot path and I02 seal remain unchanged.\n2. **W04: new actual cold consumer regression:** `test_pre553_c11_cold_reopen_i03.py` persists a sealed release using existing `ParquetC11Carrier`, reopens via exact source/release/semantic hashes (including a separate Python process), executes *real* `CarrierNeutralResearchExecutor.execute_i03` and `.execute_i05`, and compares full fact/discovery/provenance/replay material. Tests nontrivial ordered/repeated/routed and missing optional weight / valid-empty cases; corruption must refuse, explicit trusted deletion/rebuild must restore exactly. No fake source or invented authority is accepted into production.\n3. **Independent reproducibility:** new GitHub Actions sourcefree `pyat-w03-w04-physical-economy.yml` runs compact/cache, cold I03/I05, facade, carrier execution and grouped I03 tests and uploads JUnit. These are **new CI runs**, not a claimed already-passing result at PR creation.\n\n### Pre-existing independent sourcefree receiving, not new self-review\nThe compressed delta was independently reviewed at `9999c0afac5d7d7eb72ad0df602da4b232a49565`: **ACCEPT_FOCUSED_COMPRESSED_BODY_DELTA** for `02c1200b...`, 50 pass/1 environmental skip; independent 200-case full fact identity and 2,700 event hostile chunk gate. Review recorded V1 compact RSS 134.0\u219286.4 MB and warm 107.0\u219298.0 MB in its N200 comparison; **not** a guaranteed speedup or complete source-native performance. Sourcefree N1000 figures are author-grade only. See `WORKER_RETURNS/PROGRAMMA-PYAT-L03-R03-COMPRESSED-20261106-R1/00_RETURN.md` at reviewer commit.\n\n### Explicitly OPEN \u2014 cannot mark W03/W04 whole obligation complete\n- **W03 cold high-water:** I02 still constructs and validates the full logical event set before compacting. Need isolated large-source cold RSS, root authority, and exact projection first-consumer measurements. Read/projection and canonicalization costs separately measured in unmerged universal35 cost branches; do not present compressed *retained* bodies as cold-build memory victory.\n- **W04 default host policy:** authenticated persistent cache currently requires `RAWLSING_C11_ACCELERATOR_DIR`. This is an intentional private-host configuration in the accepted delta. The owner must choose default-on **for explicitly authorized repeated/long-lived workloads with safe private root** vs unqualified global disk writes. The user's direction is to make compact persistent storage an operative product capability, **not** to write restricted source-derived data to any arbitrary default directory. Cold C11 Parquet reopen is a separate canonical carrier; cache is disposable.\n- **Actual native efficiency:** benchmark cold/warm/deletion/rebuild on current host at relevant 35-source original-scale shapes, not just fixtures; capture wall/CPU/peak RSS/cache bytes/opens/first consumer exact material. The sourcefree accepted measurements previously showed that cold cache writing may cost more than it saves; preserve negative.\n- **Current native permission and original35 issuer:** no source/science permission promoted. The already-existing original35 U/Epre and ZAK authority holds are not bypassed.\n- **Independent receiving of this exact PRE-MAIN-based head:** existing reviewer accepts the previous code blobs, not the new cold test, workflow, or current integrated head. No terminal or protected status is claimed.\n\n### Closure contract, without task flattening\nW03 can close only when compact hot selection, exact cold reconstruction, same identity, and real workload resource proof pass at required scope. W04 can close only when persisted exact-source/projection/authority/version state is useful across real process restarts; stale/corrupt/revoked material cannot become supported facts; activation is explicitly governed and measured. An accepted scoped code transplant is not completion of the whole selected W03/W04 physical destination. No protected merge or independent-proof promotion.", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:14:30Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-10T23:18:23Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": "d5f00dd0357df0909e0083dbf33ec3fe864e0464", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "maidiu:agent/pyat-w03-w04-physical-economy-20261110-r1", "ref": "agent/pyat-w03-w04-physical-economy-20261110-r1", "repo": {"id": 1332719445, "node_id": "R_kgDOT2-vVQ", "name": "rawlsing", "full_name": "maidiu/rawlsing", "owner": {"login": "maidiu", "id": 103524263, "node_id": "U_kgDOBiunpw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103524263?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/maidiu", "html_url": "https://github.com/maidiu", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/maidiu/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/maidiu/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/maidiu/gists{/gist_id}",